Rāma passes elders Brāhmaṇas and gate women --- Women announce Rāma to worshipping Kausalyā --- Kausalyā greets Rāma and foretells consecration --- Rāma announces fourteen-year forest exile --- Rāma lifts fallen plantain-like mother --- Kausalyā wishes childlessness over such grief --- Kausalyā dreads neglect under Kaikēyī rule --- Kausalyā laments vain fasts vows and austerities